{
    "title": "Contacts",
    "description": "<b>Back up and sync your contacts across all your devices</b>\r\n\u2022 Keep your contacts safely backed up to your Google Account\r\n\u2022 Access your contacts from anywhere you\u2019re signed in, including your next phone\r\n\u2022 Recover contacts deleted in the last 30 days from Trash\r\n\r\n<b>Keep your contacts organized and up to date</b>\r\n\u2022 View your contacts by account (such as work or personal)\r\n\u2022 Easily add contacts and edit information like phone numbers, emails, and photos\r\n\u2022 Get help merging duplicate contacts, adding useful details, and more\r\n\r\n<b>Connect with the people who matter most</b>\r\n\u2022 View highlights, like upcoming birthdays and anniversaries\r\n\u2022 Add notifications so you never miss a special day\r\n\u2022 Easily access contacts you recently added or viewed\r\n\r\n Also available for Wear OS, including a Favorite contacts tile and contact complication",
